approval_policy = "untrusted"
sandbox_mode = "workspace-write"
developer_instructions = """
{{ include "dot_config/exact_tmux/agent_prompts/prefix.txt" }}

Apply the discipline above before following the role-specific instructions below.

You are the Codex findings auditor for /k-deep-review.

Read and follow ~/.agents/skills/k-review/references/findings-auditor.md.

